### ==============================================================================
### EDUPULSE CAMPUS SOCIAL APPLICATION - API TEST SUITE
### Built for VS Code REST Client (100% Free & Open-Source Forever)
### Click "Send Request" above any block to execute!
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081
@collegeId = 1
@branchId = 1
@studentRoll = Y24CD001
@studentEmail = y24cd001@rvrjc.ac.in
@testUserId = 84
@testPostId = 1

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. AUTHENTICATION & SECURITY
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 1.1 Login with Roll Number & Password
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "{{studentRoll}}",
  "password": "BrandNewPass@2026"
}

### 1.2 Register New Student (Matches College Roster)
# Note: In EduPulse, each student can only be registered once.
# If already registered, it returns 400 "ALREADY_REGISTERED".
# Next available unregistered students: Y24CD006, Y24CD006, Y24CD007
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register-student
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rollNumber": "Y24CD006",
  "email": "Y24CD006@rvrjc.ac.in",
  "password": "SecurePassword@2026"
}

### 1.3 Forgot Password - Send Real OTP to College Email
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/forgot-password/send-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "{{studentRoll}}"
}

### 1.4 Forgot Password - Verify 6-Digit Email OTP
# Note: Enter the actual 6-digit code received in the email from 1.3
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/forgot-password/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{studentEmail}}",
  "otp": "123456"
}

### 1.5 Get All Registered Users Directory
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/users

### 1.6 Inspect Database Schema
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/inspect-db


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. CAMPUS FEED & POSTS
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 2.1 Get College-Wide Feed
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/college-feed?collegeId={{collegeId}}

### 2.2 Get Branch-Isolated Feed (Branch 1 - CSD)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/branch-feed?collegeId={{collegeId}}&branchId={{branchId}}

### 2.3 Create Text Post
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/create
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

collegeId={{collegeId}}&targetBranchId={{branchId}}&authorId={{testUserId}}&content=Excited+for+the+upcoming+hackathon!


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. INSTAGRAM-STYLE SOCIAL INTERACTIONS (Targeting Post #1)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 3.1 Toggle Heart Like
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/social/posts/{{testPostId}}/like?userId={{testUserId}}

### 3.2 Add Comment to Post
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/social/posts/{{testPostId}}/comments
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

userId={{testUserId}}&commentText=Great+project!+Looking+forward+to+this.

### 3.3 Get Comments Thread
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/social/posts/{{testPostId}}/comments

### 3.4 Toggle Bookmark / Save Post
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/social/posts/{{testPostId}}/bookmark?userId={{testUserId}}

### 3.5 Get Saved Bookmarks
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/social/bookmarks?userId={{testUserId}}

### 3.6 Track Share
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/social/posts/{{testPostId}}/share?userId={{testUserId}}

### 3.7 Get Live Post Stats (Likes, Comments, Shares)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/social/posts/{{testPostId}}/stats?userId={{testUserId}}


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. VIDEO REELS ENGINE
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 4.1 Get All Video Reels
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reels/all?collegeId={{collegeId}}

### 4.2 Filter Reels by Category (TECHNICAL)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reels/filter?collegeId={{collegeId}}&type=TECHNICAL


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. NOTIFICATIONS HUB
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 5.1 Get User Notification Feed
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/user/{{testUserId}}

### 5.2 Mark All Notifications as Read
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/mark-all-read/{{testUserId}}


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. PROFILES & PORTFOLIO
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 6.1 Get Student Activities
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/profile/student/{{testUserId}}/activities

### 6.2 Get Student Certifications
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/profile/student/{{testUserId}}/certifications


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 7. EVENTS & OPPORTUNITIES HUB
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 7.1 Get All Campus Events
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/events/all

### 7.2 Filter Events by Category (Hackathons)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/events/category?category=Hackathons

### 7.3 Search Events by Query / Keyword
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/events/search?query=hackathon


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 8. PRIVATE BRANCH NOTICEBOARD
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 8.1 Get Branch Private Circulars (Branch 1 - CSD)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notices/my-branch?branchId={{branchId}}
